  76:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_pcd_ex.c ****       When a TxFIFO is not used, the Configuration should be as follows:
  77:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_pcd_ex.c ****           case 1 :  n > m    and Txn is not used    (n,m  : Transmit FIFO indexes)
  78:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_pcd_ex.c ****          --> Txm can use the space allocated for Txn.
  79:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_pcd_ex.c ****          case2  :  n < m    and Txn is not used    (n,m  : Transmit FIFO indexes)
  80:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_pcd_ex.c ****          --> Txn should be configured with the minimum space of 16 words
  81:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_pcd_ex.c ****      The FIFO is used optimally when used TxFIFOs are allocated in the top
  82:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_pcd_ex.c ****          of the FIFO.Ex: use EP1 and EP2 as IN instead of EP1 and EP3 as IN ones.
  83:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_pcd_ex.c ****      When DMA is used 3n * FIFO locations should be reserved for internal DMA registers */
